      "code": "PROCEDURE FIND ALL ANAGRAMS IN A STRING\n    mode ← 'anagrams'\n    IF length(t) == 0\n        RETURN (TRUE IF (mode = 'permutation') ELSE [])\n    a ← characters of s\n    need ← empty frequency table\n    result ← []\n    FOR EACH c in t\n        need[c] ← (count(need, c) + 1)\n    left ← 0\n    missing ← length(t)\n    right ← 0\n    WHILE (right < length(a))\n        c ← a[right]\n        IF c IS IN need\n            IF (count(need, c) > 0)\n                DECREASE missing BY 1\n            need[c] ← (count(need, c) - 1)\n        IF (((right - left) + 1) > length(t))\n            outgoing ← a[left]\n            INCREASE left BY 1\n            IF outgoing IS IN need\n                need[outgoing] ← (count(need, outgoing) + 1)\n                IF (count(need, outgoing) > 0)\n                    INCREASE missing BY 1\n        IF ((((right - left) + 1) = length(t)) AND (missing = 0))\n            APPEND left TO result\n            IF (mode = 'permutation')\n                RETURN TRUE\n        INCREASE right BY 1\n    RETURN (FALSE IF (mode = 'permutation') ELSE result)",
