      "code": "PROCEDURE SUBSTRING WITH CONCATENATION OF ALL WORDS\n    width ← length(words[0])\n    need ← empty frequency table\n    result ← []\n    a ← characters of s\n    FOR EACH word in words\n        need[word] ← (count(need, word) + 1)\n    offset ← 0\n    WHILE (offset < width)\n        left ← offset\n        count ← 0\n        seen ← empty frequency table\n        right ← offset\n        WHILE ((right + width) <= length(s))\n            word ← slice of s from right up to (right + width) (exclusive)\n            IF NOT word IS IN need\n                CLEAR seen\n                count ← 0\n                left ← (right + width)\n                right ← right + width\n                CONTINUE LOOP\n            seen[word] ← (count(seen, word) + 1)\n            INCREASE count BY 1\n            WHILE (count(seen, word) > count(need, word))\n                outgoing ← slice of s from left up to (left + width) (exclusive)\n                seen[outgoing] ← (count(seen, outgoing) - 1)\n                left ← left + width\n                DECREASE count BY 1\n            IF (count = length(words))\n                APPEND left TO result\n            right ← right + width\n        INCREASE offset BY 1\n    RETURN result",
