      "code": "def solve(a, lower, upper):\n    prefix = [0] * (len(a) + 1)\n    buffer = [0] * (len(a) + 1)\n    read = 0\n    while (read < len(a)):\n        prefix[(read + 1)] = (prefix[read] + a[read])\n        read += 1\n    count = 0\n    width = 1\n    while (width < len(prefix)):\n        start = 0\n        while (start < len(prefix)):\n            mid = min((start + width), len(prefix))\n            end = min((start + (2 * width)), len(prefix))\n            low = mid\n            high = mid\n            left = start\n            while (left < mid):\n                while ((low < end) and ((prefix[low] - prefix[left]) < lower)):\n                    low += 1\n                while ((high < end) and ((prefix[high] - prefix[left]) <= upper)):\n                    high += 1\n                count += (high - low)\n                left += 1\n            left = start\n            right = mid\n            write = start\n            while (write < end):\n                if ((left < mid) and ((right >= end) or (prefix[left] <= prefix[right]))):\n                    buffer[write] = prefix[left]\n                    left += 1\n                else:\n                    buffer[write] = prefix[right]\n                    right += 1\n                write += 1\n            write = start\n            while (write < end):\n                prefix[write] = buffer[write]\n                write += 1\n            start += (2 * width)\n        width *= 2\n    return count",
