      "code": "def solve(a, left, right):\n    k = 2\n    mode = 'sub'\n    next = [i + 1 if i + 1 < len(a) else -1 for i in range(len(a))]\n    head = (0 if len(a) > 0 else (-1))\n    before = (-1)\n    current = head\n    planned = (len(a) if (mode == 'full') else (((right - left) + 1) if (mode == 'sub') else (1 if (mode == 'even') else k)))\n    if (mode == 'sub'):\n        position = 1\n        while (position < left):\n            before = current\n            current = next[current]\n            position += 1\n    while (current != (-1)):\n        after = current\n        count = 0\n        last = current\n        while ((after != (-1)) and (count < planned)):\n            last = after\n            after = next[after]\n            count += 1\n        reverse = (((count % 2) == 0) if (mode == 'even') else (count == planned))\n        if reverse:\n            tail = current\n            previous = after\n            while (current != after):\n                following = next[current]\n                next[current] = previous\n                previous = current\n                current = following\n            if (before == (-1)):\n                head = previous\n            else:\n                next[before] = previous\n            before = tail\n        else:\n            before = last\n            current = after\n        if ((mode == 'sub') or (mode == 'full')):\n            break\n        if (mode == 'even'):\n            planned += 1\n    result = []\n    node = head\n    while (node != (-1)):\n        result.append(a[node])\n        node = next[node]\n    return result",
