      "code": "PROCEDURE REVERSE LINKED LIST II\n    k ← 2\n    mode ← 'sub'\n    CONNECT consecutive nodes; link the last node to NONE\n    head ← (0 IF length(a) ELSE -1)\n    before ← -1\n    current ← head\n    planned ← (length(a) IF (mode = 'full') ELSE (((right - left) + 1) IF (mode = 'sub') ELSE (1 IF (mode = 'even') ELSE k)))\n    IF (mode = 'sub')\n        position ← 1\n        WHILE (position < left)\n            before ← current\n            current ← next[current]\n            INCREASE position BY 1\n    WHILE (current ≠ -1)\n        after ← current\n        count ← 0\n        last ← current\n        WHILE ((after ≠ -1) AND (count < planned))\n            last ← after\n            after ← next[after]\n            INCREASE count BY 1\n        reverse ← (((count % 2) = 0) IF (mode = 'even') ELSE (count = planned))\n        IF reverse\n            tail ← current\n            previous ← after\n            WHILE (current ≠ after)\n                following ← next[current]\n                next[current] ← previous\n                previous ← current\n                current ← following\n            IF (before = -1)\n                head ← previous\n            ELSE\n                next[before] ← previous\n            before ← tail\n        ELSE\n            before ← last\n            current ← after\n        IF ((mode = 'sub') OR (mode = 'full'))\n            STOP LOOP\n        IF (mode = 'even')\n            INCREASE planned BY 1\n    result ← []\n    node ← head\n    WHILE (node ≠ -1)\n        APPEND a[node] TO result\n        node ← next[node]\n    RETURN result",
